now, are version 1.52.

00:28:11.790 --> 00:28:14.670
So now I have a notification
that a node is--

00:28:14.670 --> 00:28:16.296
upgrade is available.

00:28:16.296 --> 00:28:18.420
It also tells me that my
current cluster is running

00:28:18.420 --> 00:28:20.115
and, of course, my
master IP address.

00:28:22.690 --> 00:28:28.420
Let's take a peek
underneath, then,

00:28:28.420 --> 00:28:30.410
at my node pools for
this particular cluster.

00:28:34.240 --> 00:28:37.720
Of course, pedantically--
has to be plural.

00:28:37.720 --> 00:28:40.850
I have three node pools
configured for this cluster.

00:28:40.850 --> 00:28:43.780
I have a main focus
comprised of [INAUDIBLE].

00:28:43.780 --> 00:28:47.049
I have something that I call
a pre-pool of n1-standard-2s,

00:28:47.049 --> 00:28:49.090
and something that I called
a lowmeme pool, which

00:28:49.090 --> 00:28:51.340
