00:43:35.580 --> 00:43:39.180
whenever we do a push
on Container Engine.

00:43:39.180 --> 00:43:41.340
A lot of members of
our engineering team

00:43:41.340 --> 00:43:44.000
are on Stack Overflow, so
if you have a question that

00:43:44.000 --> 00:43:46.770
is container-engine
specific, please use

00:43:46.770 --> 00:43:50.400
the tag, the Google Container
Engine tag in Stack Overflow.

00:43:50.400 --> 00:43:53.160
And, of course, as
always, the Kubernetes

00:43:53.160 --> 00:43:56.250
GitHub depositary of highly
technical, kind of complicated.

00:43:56.250 --> 00:43:59.790
But always looking for
contributors for the Kubernetes

00:43:59.790 --> 00:44:01.760
project.

00:44:01.760 --> 00:44:03.540
And while you're
here at GCP Next,

00:44:03.540 --> 00:44:06.536
